    "text": "3 hours ago This article contains content summarized with GPT-4. Learn more.\nA local animal shelter in Sacramento has started a program to support pets and their owners. The shelter offers free pet food and operates an on-site pantry for families in need. This service helps families keep their pets during challenging times. The shelter encourages community members to get involved in these efforts.\nvideo by @GoodDaySacramento\n9",
